meta {
  name: List Audit Submissions
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit-submissions?state=submitted&page=1&page_size=20
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-Dev-User-ID: {{devUserId}}
}

params:query {
  state: submitted
  page: 1
  page_size: 20
}

docs {
  Audit queue. Joined to app_versions so we can filter by version state.
  Returns { items, total, page, page_size } ordered oldest-first (US-2).

  Auditor role required. The cross-org rule is enforced on the decision
  endpoint, not here — auditors CAN browse all submissions, they just
  can't decide on their own org's apps.

  Filters:
    state       app_versions.state (default: submitted)
    risk_class  filter by manifest risk class: minimal | limited | high
    page        1-based (default 1)
    page_size   1..100 (default 20)

  Responses:
    200 OK   — paginated list
    401      — no authenticated principal
}
